# ${SRC_DIR}/types/

Shared type declarations for ${PROJECT_NAME}.

## What lives here

- [`express.d.ts`](express.d.ts) — augments Express's `Request` so `req.id` is typed.
- [`shared.ts`](shared.ts) — types reused by more than one feature.

## What does NOT live here

- Feature-local types — those live in `${SRC_DIR}/api/<version>/<feature>/types/`.
- Mongoose / pg row types — those live with their model in `${SRC_DIR}/models/`.

## Naming

- `*.d.ts` for ambient module augmentations.
- `*.ts` for ordinary exported types.

